Under the conventional heads, the learned Tribunal has awarded an amount of Rs.18,000/- towards loss of estate; Rs.18,000/- towards funeral expenses; Rs.48,000/- to claimant No.1 for spousal consortium;
Rs.48,000/- each to claimants No.2 to 4 towards parental consortium; and Rs.48,000/- each to claimants No.5 and 6 for loss of filial consortium; thereby granting total compensation of Rs.14,23,670/-.
